1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,380
Good evening everyone and thank you for coming to the Soccer Club meeting.

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:07,833
It's good to see so many parents and children here tonight,

3
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:11,600
and I know you are looking forward to a great football season.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:19,120
Now I'd like to take a few minutes to tell you about some changes to the Soccer Club for the coming season.

5
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:24,274
Now, this season we'll be playing all our matches for both the junior

6
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:27,040
and senior competitions at King's Park

7
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:30,220
instead of Royal Park, which was used last season.

8
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:34,704
Now for meetings, we're going to use the clubhouse in King's Park,

9
00:00:34,704 --> 00:00:40,310
and the next meeting will be held in the clubhouse on the 2nd of July.

10
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:46,450
As usual, we hope to begin the season with a picnic next Saturday at the clubhouse.

11
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:49,960
Please try and come to the picnic as it's always good fun.

12
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:53,380
The last week of the season we usually have a dinner

13
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,153
and presentation of prizes to the players,

14
00:00:56,153 --> 00:01:00,970
and more information about this will be given to you later in the season.

15
00:01:00,970 --> 00:01:03,970
This season we have more teams than ever.

16
00:01:03,970 --> 00:01:06,142
We hope to have ten teams,

17
00:01:06,142 --> 00:01:08,720
instead of five, in the junior competition

18
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:13,380
and they will play on Saturday mornings, beginning at 8.30 a. m.

19
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:18,840
Training sessions will be held in King's Park on Wednesday afternoons for the juniors

20
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:22,740
and they will be wearing red shirts again this year.

21
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:26,455
In the senior competition, there'll be four teams,

22
00:01:26,455 --> 00:01:28,460
the same as last year

23
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:35,742
and their games will be played on Saturday afternoons starting at 2.30, no sorry,

24
00:01:35,742 --> 00:01:38,180
it will be a 2 o'clock start

25
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:44,100
and the training session for seniors is planned for Sunday afternoons.

26
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:49,690
Now I'd like to introduce you to the new committee for the Soccer Club for this season.

27
00:01:49,690 --> 00:01:53,360
Firstly, let me welcome Robert Young

28
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:57,560
the new President, who will manage the meetings for the next two years.

29
00:01:57,560 --> 00:02:02,158
Robert's son has been playing football with the club for over five years now,

30
00:02:02,158 --> 00:02:06,100
and many thanks to Robert for taking on the job of President.

31
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:11,160
Next we have Gina Costello, she's the treasurer

32
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:14,160
and she will collect the fees from you for the season.

33
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:18,483
Please try and give Gina your fees as early as possible in the season,

34
00:02:18,483 --> 00:02:21,880
as the club needs the money to buy some new equipment.

35
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:26,423
Then there's David West who has volunteered to be the club secretary,

36
00:02:26,423 --> 00:02:32,860
and one of the many jobs he will have is to send out newsletters to you regularly.

37
00:02:32,860 --> 00:02:35,793
If you have any information that may be useful,

38
00:02:35,793 --> 00:02:40,030
please let David know so that it can be included in these newsletters.

39
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:46,600
Also I'd like to introduce you to Jason Dokic who is the Head Coach.

40
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,580
For all the new members here tonight

41
00:02:48,580 --> 00:02:52,789
this is the third year that Jason has been with us as Head Coach,

42
00:02:52,789 --> 00:02:55,680
and we are very lucky to have such an experienced coach

43
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,800
and former player at our club.

44
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:04,260
He will continue to supervise the teams, at training sessions and on match days.

45
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:07,436
Now before we finish and have some refreshments,

46
00:03:07,436 --> 00:03:12,200
does anyone have any questions they'd like to ask the new committee?
